T[12744]={"^The Void Singularity channels the power of the void into Ossirian%.\n\nDamage dealt increased by (.-)%%%.%s*$","A Singularidade do Vazio canalizao poder do vazio cima Ossirian.\n\nAumenta o dano causado em {{1}}%."}
